// Names for rival wizards when the original's ready-made wizards are not imported
// (`content-local/wizards.ron`). One list for each rival slot, first rival first; a game draws
// one name (with its gender) from each list (a game with a fifth wizard uses the fourth list for the last).
// Invented names, not the original's.
